@UnseenWorldDocs_Us  Probably about the cost of living in Monaco, and thinking that people that live here are stand offish or snobbish.

As I previously mentioned, one can obviously live expensively here if one can afford it, but it's quite possible to live here no more expensively than in any other city in developed countries.

As Monaco is a small place, and very international, residents tend to know each other, and one will often find people mingling that have a very different financial status.

@jamesbanish-qi2vr There are many people that live in Monaco that are not billionaires, or indeed, even millionaires. Indeed, many native Monégasque nationals are on benefits and receive social housing from Monaco
The Monaco restrictions to the casino only apply to Monaco nationals.

It is true though, that many of the people that live here tend to leave during the F!, whilst also renting out their apartments that have good views of the race.

@UnseenWorldDocs_Us There is another aspect in addition to what I previously mentioned. The majority of the people that move here are aware that it is safe in Monaco, but many are surprised at just how safe and crime free it is.

I don’t know if you know but many of the yachts here go out to sea but stay relatively 'local', tending to go only a few hundred miles. For long journeys, such as to the Caribbean, where some go to for the winter, a yacht transporter is used.

There is also, on some of the super yachts (not the ordinary yachts) , dinner parties held, where the invited guest receive very sumptuous gifts.

@UnseenWorldDocs_Us Simple, Monaco is one of the biggest employers in Provence, many Italians come in by train every morning, and French and other nationalites from surrounding areas such as Nice.
There are also people that have live in positions, and, bear in mind, there are many apartments in Monaco, away from the centre, that have normal rent.
And obviously, there are the Monegasque that work in Monaco, some own their apartments, some rent, whilst other Monagesque are provided with social housing by Monaco.
